# The best overlap of a decaying exponential with a Gaussian is 80.1%, reached when leakage times beam radius is 1.369.
# Reference: closed form, and the limit itself.
title Uniform grating at the optimal leakage
grating angle=10 length=60
leak 0.259281
expect radiated 0.99999982 1e-06
expect overlap 0.80098194 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.40049090 2e-05
expect position 3.85906939 0.005
expect overlap 0.80098 2e-4
